	(text "ASSUMPTION: Fastest pedal stomp: 50ms, Inverter's noise: 10kHz\nDelay: τ = 1ms (5τ = 5ms, 1% of the 500ms)\nFORMULAS: f = 0.35/t, f_C = 1/(2π*t)\nRESOLUTION: f = 0.35/0.05s = 7Hz -> 10Hz\nf_C = 1/(2π*1ms) = 160HZ(teorical)(2π*t)\nC_F = 100nF(standard)\nR_TOT = 1/(2π*160 Hz*100 nF) = 9.95kΩ\nR_IN = 9.95k - 100 = 9.85 -> 10K\nCONFIRMATION: \nf_C = 1 / (2π × 10.1 kΩ × 100 nF) = 158HZ\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125.222 120.142 0)
		(effects
